/* ============================================================
   SECTION 2: D\u00f6ng\u00fcler ve \u0130terasyon
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">2. D\u00f6ng\u00fcler ve \u0130terasyon</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Temel fikir:</strong> D\u00f6ng\u00fcler, bir kod blo\u011funu tekrar tekrar \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flar. Python\'da iki d\u00f6ng\u00fc t\u00fcr\u00fc vard\u0131r: <code>for</code> (bir dizi \u00fczerinde yineleme) ve <code>while</code> (bir ko\u015ful do\u011fru oldu\u011fu s\u00fcrece tekrarla). Python\'un yineleyici protokol\u00fc \u00e7ok g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc oldu\u011fu i\u00e7in <code>for</code> d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc zamanın ~%90\'ında kullanılır.</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong><code>for</code> d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc</strong> herhangi bir <em>yinelenebilir</em> (iterable) \u00fczerinde yineleme yapar \u2014 listeler, dizeler, aral\u0131klar, s\u00f6zl\u00fckler, dosyalar, \u00fcreteciler ve daha fazlas\u0131:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># Temel for d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc</span>\n<span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">5</span>):\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(i, end=<span class="str">" "</span>)  <span class="cm"># 0 1 2 3 4</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># enumerate() \u2014 indeks VE de\u011fer al</span>\nmeyveler = [<span class="str">"elma"</span>, <span class="str">"muz"</span>, <span class="str">"kiraz"</span>]\n<span class="kw">for</span> idx, meyve <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">enumerate</span>(meyveler):\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"{idx}: {meyve}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># zip() \u2014 birden fazla diziyi paralel yinele</span>\nisimler = [<span class="str">"Ay\u015fe"</span>, <span class="str">"Mehmet"</span>, <span class="str">"Can"</span>]\npuanlar = [<span class="num">92</span>, <span class="num">87</span>, <span class="num">78</span>]\n<span class="kw">for</span> isim, puan <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">zip</span>(isimler, puanlar):\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"{isim}: {puan}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u00f6zl\u00fck \u00fczerinde yineleme</span>\nayarlar = {<span class="str">"lr"</span>: <span class="num">0.001</span>, <span class="str">"epoch"</span>: <span class="num">50</span>, <span class="str">"batch"</span>: <span class="num">32</span>}\n<span class="kw">for</span> anahtar, deger <span class="kw">in</span> ayarlar.items():\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"{anahtar} = {deger}"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

/* --- D\u00f6ng\u00fc Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rma Tablosu --- */
+ '<p class="l-text">Python\'da kullanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z t\u00fcm b\u00fcy\u00fck d\u00f6ng\u00fc kal\u0131plar\u0131n\u0131n kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131:</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F501;</div><div class="cc-title">range(n)</div><div class="cc-body">0\'dan n-1\'e kadar tamsay\u0131 \u00fcretir.<br><code>range(3)</code> \u2192 0, 1, 2<br><code>range(2,8,2)</code> \u2192 2, 4, 6<br>Bellek verimli: talep \u00fczerine \u00fcretir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F522;</div><div class="cc-title">enumerate()</div><div class="cc-body">Herhangi bir yinelenebilire say\u0131\u00e7 ekler.<br>(indeks, eleman) \u00e7iftleri d\u00f6ner.<br>Manuel indeks takibini \u00f6nler.<br><code>start=</code> parametresi alabilir.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F500;</div><div class="cc-title">zip()</div><div class="cc-body">2+ yinelenebilirden elemanlar\u0131 e\u015fler.<br>En k\u0131sa yinelenebilirde durur.<br>Dolgu i\u00e7in itertools\'tan <code>zip_longest</code>.<br><code>zip(*ciftler)</code> ile ay\u0131r.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F504;</div><div class="cc-title">while</div><div class="cc-body">Ko\u015ful False olana kadar tekrarlar.<br>Sonsuz d\u00f6ng\u00fc riski!<br>Bilinmeyen yineleme say\u0131s\u0131 i\u00e7in kullan\u0131n.<br>Yayg\u0131n: girdi okuma, yak\u0131nsama.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

/* --- While d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc & kontrol --- */
+ '<p class="l-text"><strong><code>while</code> d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc</strong>, bir ko\u015ful ge\u00e7erli oldu\u011fu s\u00fcrece tekrarlar. Ka\u00e7 yineleme gerekti\u011fini bilmedi\u011finizde kullan\u0131n \u2014 \u00f6rne\u011fin kay\u0131p yak\u0131nsayana kadar bir model e\u011fitmek:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># Yak\u0131nsama kontrol\u00fcl\u00fc while d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc (ML tarz\u0131)</span>\nkayip = <span class="num">10.0</span>\nepoch = <span class="num">0</span>\n<span class="kw">while</span> kayip > <span class="num">0.01</span>:\n    kayip *= <span class="num">0.85</span>\n    epoch += <span class="num">1</span>\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Epoch {epoch}: kay\u0131p = {kayip:.4f}"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># break \u2014 d\u00f6ng\u00fcden hemen \u00e7\u0131k</span>\n<span class="kw">for</span> n <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">1000</span>):\n    <span class="kw">if</span> n ** <span class="num">2</span> > <span class="num">500</span>:\n        <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"n^2 > 500 olan ilk n: {n}"</span>)\n        <span class="kw">break</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># continue \u2014 bu yinelemeyi atla, sonrakine ge\u00e7</span>\n<span class="kw">for</span> i <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">10</span>):\n    <span class="kw">if</span> i % <span class="num">3</span> == <span class="num">0</span>:\n        <span class="kw">continue</span>  <span class="cm"># 3\'\u00fcn katlar\u0131n\u0131 atla</span>\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(i, end=<span class="str">" "</span>)  <span class="cm"># 1 2 4 5 7 8</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># for/else \u2014 d\u00f6ng\u00fc break OLMADAN tamamlan\u0131rsa \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r</span>\n<span class="kw">for</span> n <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">20</span>):\n    <span class="kw">for</span> d <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">2</span>, n):\n        <span class="kw">if</span> n % d == <span class="num">0</span>:\n            <span class="kw">break</span>\n    <span class="kw">else</span>:\n        <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"{n} asal say\u0131d\u0131r"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>Profesyonel ipucu:</strong> <code>for/else</code> kal\u0131b\u0131 Python\'a \u00f6zg\u00fcd\u00fcr. <code>else</code> blo\u011fu yaln\u0131zca d\u00f6ng\u00fc normal \u015fekilde tamamland\u0131\u011f\u0131nda (<code>break</code> yok) \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Arama i\u015flemleri i\u00e7in m\u00fckemmeldir: d\u00f6ng\u00fc arar, bulursa <code>break</code>, bulamazsa <code>else</code> "bulunamad\u0131" durumunu i\u015fler.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 3: Kavramalar (Comprehensions)
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">3. Kavramalar (Comprehensions)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Temel fikir:</strong> Kavramalar Python\'un en zarif \u00f6zelli\u011fidir \u2014 tek bir ifadeyle liste, s\u00f6zl\u00fck ve k\u00fcme olu\u015fturman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flar. Sadece s\u00f6zdizimsel \u015feker de\u011fildir: kavramalar, Python i\u00e7ten \u00f6zel bytecode ile optimize etti\u011fi i\u00e7in e\u015fde\u011fer for d\u00f6ng\u00fclerinden <em>daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r</em>.</div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Liste kavramasi</strong> en yaygin formdur. Sozdizimi <code>[ifade for eleman in yinelenebilir if kosul]</code>:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># Temel liste kavram\u0131</span>\nkareler = [x**<span class="num">2</span> <span class="kw">for</span> x <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">10</span>)]\n<span class="cm"># [0, 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Filtre ko\u015fulu ile</span>\ncift_kareler = [x**<span class="num">2</span> <span class="kw">for</span> x <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">10</span>) <span class="kw">if</span> x % <span class="num">2</span> == <span class="num">0</span>]\n<span class="cm"># [0, 4, 16, 36, 64]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u00f6zl\u00fck kavram\u0131</span>\nkelime_uzunluklari = {k: <span class="fn">len</span>(k) <span class="kw">for</span> k <span class="kw">in</span> [<span class="str">"merhaba"</span>, <span class="str">"d\u00fcnya"</span>, <span class="str">"python"</span>]}\n<span class="cm"># {\'merhaba\': 7, \'d\u00fcnya\': 5, \'python\': 6}</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># K\u00fcme kavram\u0131 (tekrarlar\u0131 otomatik kald\u0131r\u0131r)</span>\nbenzersiz_uzunluklar = {<span class="fn">len</span>(k) <span class="kw">for</span> k <span class="kw">in</span> [<span class="str">"hi"</span>, <span class="str">"no"</span>, <span class="str">"evet"</span>, <span class="str">"ok"</span>]}\n<span class="cm"># {2, 4}</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00dcrete\u00e7 ifadesi (tembel \u2014 elemanlar\u0131 birer birer verir)</span>\ntoplam = <span class="fn">sum</span>(x**<span class="num">2</span> <span class="kw">for</span> x <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">1000000</span>))  <span class="cm"># bellekte liste yok!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u0130\u00e7 i\u00e7e kavram \u2014 2B listeyi d\u00fczle\u015ftirme</span>\nmatris = [[<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>], [<span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">5</span>, <span class="num">6</span>], [<span class="num">7</span>, <span class="num">8</span>, <span class="num">9</span>]]\nduz = [sayi <span class="kw">for</span> satir <span class="kw">in</span> matris <span class="kw">for</span> sayi <span class="kw">in</span> satir]\n<span class="cm"># [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]</span></code></pre></div>'

/* --- Yan yana kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rma --- */
+ '<p class="l-text">Kavramalar\u0131 anlamak i\u00e7in, for d\u00f6ng\u00fc kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131yla yan yana g\u00f6r\u00fcn:</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare"><div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-label">FOR D\u00d6NG\u00dcS\u00dc</div><div class="compare-body"><pre><code>sonuc = []\n<span class="kw">for</span> x <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">10</span>):\n    <span class="kw">if</span> x % <span class="num">2</span> == <span class="num">0</span>:\n        sonuc.append(x ** <span class="num">2</span>)\n<span class="cm"># 4 sat\u0131r, listeyi manuel olu\u015fturur</span></code></pre></div></div><div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-label">KAVRAM</div><div class="compare-body"><pre><code>sonuc = [x**<span class="num">2</span> <span class="kw">for</span> x <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">10</span>)\n          <span class="kw">if</span> x % <span class="num">2</span> == <span class="num">0</span>]\n\n<span class="cm"># 1 ifade, ~%30 daha h\u0131zl\u0131</span></code></pre></div></div></div>'

+ '<div class="think-box"><div class="think-label">D\u00dc\u015e\u00dcN\u00dcN</div><div class="think-body"><strong>Kavramalar\u0131 ne zaman KULLANMAMALI:</strong> Mant\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z birden fazla ifade, yan etkiler (yazd\u0131rma gibi) gerektiriyorsa veya sat\u0131r ba\u015f\u0131na ~80 karakteri a\u015f\u0131yorsa, normal for d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc kullan\u0131n. Okunabilirlik zekal\u0131l\u0131ktan daha \u00f6nemlidir.</div></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Performans Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 --- */
+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="cg-title">Performans: Kavram vs D\u00f6ng\u00fc vs map()</div></div>'
+ '<div id="plot-comp-perf-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var methods=["for + append","liste kavram\u0131","map() + lambda","\u00fcrete\u00e7 ifadesi"];'
+ 'var times=[4.2,2.8,3.1,2.5];'
