+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="cg-caption">Kavramalar, .append() ile for d\u00f6ng\u00fclerinden ~%30-40 daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc Python metot arama y\u00fck\u00fcn\u00fc \u00f6nler ve optimize edilmi\u015f dahili i\u015flemler kullan\u0131r. \u00dcrete\u00e7 ifadeleri yaln\u0131zca bir kez yinelemeniz gerekti\u011finde en h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r (liste tahsisi yok).</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 4: Fonksiyonlar Derinlemesine
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">4. Fonksiyonlar Derinlemesine</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Temel fikir:</strong> Fonksiyonlar, Python\'da kod yeniden kullan\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n temel birimidir. \u0130yi tasarlanm\u0131\u015f bir fonksiyon <strong>tek bir \u015fey</strong> yapar, a\u00e7\u0131k bir isme sahiptir, girdileri parametre olarak kabul eder ve \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131lar d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Fonksiyonlar kodunuzu monolitik bir betikten mod\u00fcler, test edilebilir, birle\u015ftirilebilir yapı taşlarına dönüştürür.</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">vki_hesapla</span>(kilo_kg: <span class="fn">float</span>, boy_m: <span class="fn">float</span>) -> <span class="fn">float</span>:\n    <span class="str">"""V\u00fccut Kitle \u0130ndeksini hesapla.\n\n    Args:\n        kilo_kg: Kilogram cinsinden a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k.\n        boy_m: Metre cinsinden boy.\n\n    Returns:\n        VK\u0130 de\u011feri (float).\n    """</span>\n    <span class="kw">if</span> boy_m <= <span class="num">0</span>:\n        <span class="kw">raise</span> <span class="fn">ValueError</span>(<span class="str">"Boy pozitif olmal\u0131d\u0131r"</span>)\n    <span class="kw">return</span> kilo_kg / (boy_m ** <span class="num">2</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Birden fazla d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f de\u011feri (asl\u0131nda tuple d\u00f6ner)</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">min_max</span>(sayilar):\n    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="fn">min</span>(sayilar), <span class="fn">max</span>(sayilar)\n\nen_kucuk, en_buyuk = <span class="fn">min_max</span>([<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">5</span>])\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"Aral\u0131k: {en_kucuk} - {en_buyuk}"</span>)  <span class="cm"># Aral\u0131k: 1 - 5</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Tip ipuçları</strong> (<code>kilo_kg: float</code> ve <code>-> float</code> gibi) çalışma zamanında tip zorlamaz — Python dinamik tipli kalır. Ancak dokümantasyon görevi görür, IDE otomatik tamamlamayı etkinleştirir ve <code>mypy</code> gibi araçların kodunuz çalışmadan önce hataları yakalamasını sağlar.</p>'

/* --- Parametre T\u00fcrleri Kart Izgaras\u0131 --- */
+ '<p class="l-text">Python fonksiyonlar\u0131 inan\u0131lmaz esnek bir parametre sistemi destekler. Bilmeniz gereken her parametre t\u00fcr\u00fc:</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F4E5;</div><div class="cc-title">Konumsal Args</div><div class="cc-body"><code>def f(a, b):</code><br>Konuma g\u00f6re e\u015fle\u015fir. <code>f(1, 2)</code> a=1, b=2 yapar.<br>S\u0131ra \u00f6nemlidir. Varsay\u0131lan olarak zorunlu.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F3F7;</div><div class="cc-title">Varsay\u0131lan De\u011ferler</div><div class="cc-body"><code>def f(a, b=10):</code><br>b iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131, varsay\u0131lan 10.<br><strong>TEHL\u0130KE:</strong> Asla <code>b=[]</code> gibi de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir varsay\u0131lan kullanmay\u0131n!</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F4E6;</div><div class="cc-title">*args</div><div class="cc-body"><code>def f(*args):</code><br>Fazla konumsal arg\u00fcmanlar\u0131 tuple olarak yakalar.<br><code>f(1,2,3)</code> \u2192 args=(1,2,3)</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F5C2;</div><div class="cc-title">**kwargs</div><div class="cc-body"><code>def f(**kwargs):</code><br>Fazla anahtar kelime arg\u00fcmanlar\u0131n\u0131 dict olarak yakalar.<br><code>f(lr=0.01)</code> \u2192 kwargs={\'lr\':0.01}</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F512;</div><div class="cc-title">Sadece Anahtar Kelime</div><div class="cc-body"><code>def f(a, *, key):</code><br>*\'dan sonraki arg\u00fcmanlar anahtar kelime s\u00f6zdizimi kullanmal\u0131.<br><code>f(1, key=2)</code> \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. <code>f(1, 2)</code> ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="cc-icon">&#x1F4CD;</div><div class="cc-title">Sadece Konumsal</div><div class="cc-body"><code>def f(a, /, b):</code><br>/\'den \u00f6nceki arg\u00fcmanlar sadece konumsal (3.8+).<br><code>f(1, b=2)</code> \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. <code>f(a=1, b=2)</code> ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

/* --- De\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir Varsay\u0131lan Tuzak --- */
+ '<div class="l-warn"><strong>De\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir Varsay\u0131lan Tuzak:</strong> Bu, en yayg\u0131n Python hatalar\u0131ndan biridir. Varsay\u0131lan arg\u00fcman de\u011ferleri her \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131da de\u011fil, fonksiyon tan\u0131m\u0131nda <strong>bir kez</strong> de\u011ferlendirilir. De\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir bir varsay\u0131lan (liste, s\u00f6zl\u00fck, k\u00fcme) kullan\u0131rsan\u0131z, \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131lar aras\u0131nda devam eder!</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># HATA: de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir varsay\u0131lan arg\u00fcman</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">eleman_ekle_yanlis</span>(eleman, liste=[]):\n    liste.append(eleman)\n    <span class="kw">return</span> liste\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">eleman_ekle_yanlis</span>(<span class="str">"a"</span>))  <span class="cm"># [\'a\']           — sorunsuz g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">eleman_ekle_yanlis</span>(<span class="str">"b"</span>))  <span class="cm"># [\'a\', \'b\']      — NE?!</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">eleman_ekle_yanlis</span>(<span class="str">"c"</span>))  <span class="cm"># [\'a\', \'b\', \'c\'] — liste b\u00fcy\u00fcyor!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># D\u00dcZELTME: None varsay\u0131lan kullan, i\u00e7eride olu\u015ftur</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">eleman_ekle_dogru</span>(eleman, liste=<span class="kw">None</span>):\n    <span class="kw">if</span> liste <span class="kw">is</span> <span class="kw">None</span>:\n        liste = []\n    liste.append(eleman)\n    <span class="kw">return</span> liste\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">eleman_ekle_dogru</span>(<span class="str">"a"</span>))  <span class="cm"># [\'a\']</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">eleman_ekle_dogru</span>(<span class="str">"b"</span>))  <span class="cm"># [\'b\']  — her seferinde yeni liste!</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="ce-label">&#x1F3AF; Ger\u00e7ek D\u00fcnya *args/**kwargs \u00d6rne\u011fi</div><p class="l-text">Bu kal\u0131p ML \u00e7er\u00e7evelerinde her yerdedir \u2014 alt k\u00fct\u00fcphanelere se\u00e7enek ileten yap\u0131land\u0131rma fonksiyonlar\u0131:</p><pre><code><span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">model_egit</span>(model, veri, *,\n                epoch_sayisi=<span class="num">10</span>, lr=<span class="num">0.001</span>,\n                **optimizer_kwargs):\n    <span class="str">"""Esnek optimizer yap\u0131land\u0131rmas\u0131yla e\u011fit."""</span>\n    optimizer = Adam(model.parameters(),\n                     lr=lr, **optimizer_kwargs)\n    <span class="kw">for</span> epoch <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="fn">range</span>(epoch_sayisi):\n        <span class="cm"># e\u011fitim d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fc...</span>\n        <span class="kw">pass</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Temiz API: isimli arg + rastgele ekstralar</span>\nmodel_egit(ag, veri,\n           epoch_sayisi=<span class="num">20</span>, lr=<span class="num">0.0003</span>,\n           weight_decay=<span class="num">1e-5</span>, betas=(<span class="num">0.9</span>, <span class="num">0.999</span>))</code></pre></div>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 5: Kapsam ve Kapanışlar
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">5. Kapsam ve Kapanışlar (Closures)</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Temel fikir:</strong> Kapsam (scope), bir de\u011fi\u015fkenin nerede eri\u015filebilir oldu\u011funu belirler. Python isimleri \u00e7\u00f6zmek i\u00e7in <strong>LEGB kural\u0131n\u0131</strong> kullan\u0131r: \u00f6nce Yerel (Local), sonra \u00c7evreleyen (Enclosing), sonra Genel (Global), sonra Yerle\u015fik (Built-in) kapsamlar\u0131 arar — tam olarak bu s\u0131rayla.</div>'

/* --- LEGB Ad\u0131mlar\u0131 --- */
+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="cs-num">L</div><div class="cs-content"><div class="cs-title">Yerel Kapsam (Local)</div><div class="cs-detail">Mevcut fonksiyonun i\u00e7inde tan\u0131mlanan de\u011fi\u015fkenler. Fonksiyon \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda olu\u015fturulur, d\u00f6nd\u00fc\u011f\u00fcnde yok edilir. Her fonksiyon \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131s\u0131 kendi yerel kapsam\u0131n\u0131 al\u0131r.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="cs-num">E</div><div class="cs-content"><div class="cs-title">\u00c7evreleyen Kapsam (Enclosing)</div><div class="cs-detail">\u0130\u00e7 i\u00e7e fonksiyonlarda d\u0131\u015f fonksiyondaki de\u011fi\u015fkenler. Kapan\u0131\u015flar burada ya\u015far — d\u0131\u015f fonksiyon d\u00f6nse bile i\u00e7 fonksiyon \u00e7evreleyen kapsam\u0131 "hat\u0131rlar".</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="cs-num">G</div><div class="cs-content"><div class="cs-title">Genel Kapsam (Global)</div><div class="cs-detail">Mod\u00fcl (dosya) seviyesinde tan\u0131mlanan de\u011fi\u015fkenler. Dosyan\u0131n her yerinden eri\u015filebilir. Fonksiyon i\u00e7inden de\u011fi\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in <code>global</code> anahtar kelimesini kullan\u0131n (ama m\u00fcmk\u00fcnse bundan ka\u00e7\u0131n\u0131n).</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="cs-num">B</div><div class="cs-content"><div class="cs-title">Yerle\u015fik Kapsam (Built-in)</div><div class="cs-detail">Python\'un \u00f6nceden tan\u0131ml\u0131 isimleri: <code>print</code>, <code>len</code>, <code>range</code>, <code>True</code>, <code>None</code> vb. Her zaman kullan\u0131labilir. Bunlar\u0131 asla kendi de\u011fi\u015fken adlar\u0131n\u0131zla g\u00f6lgelemeyin!</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code>x = <span class="str">"genel"</span>  <span class="cm"># G: genel kapsam</span>\n\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">dis</span>():\n    x = <span class="str">"cevreleyen"</span>  <span class="cm"># E: \u00e7evreleyen kapsam</span>\n\n    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">ic</span>():\n        x = <span class="str">"yerel"</span>  <span class="cm"># L: yerel kapsam</span>\n        <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"ic g\u00f6r\u00fcyor: {x}"</span>)  <span class="cm"># \u2192 "yerel"</span>\n\n    <span class="fn">ic</span>()\n    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"dis g\u00f6r\u00fcyor: {x}"</span>)  <span class="cm"># \u2192 "cevreleyen"</span>\n\n<span class="fn">dis</span>()\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"modul g\u00f6r\u00fcyor: {x}"</span>)  <span class="cm"># \u2192 "genel"</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># global ve nonlocal anahtar kelimeleri</span>\nsayac = <span class="num">0</span>\n\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">artir</span>():\n    <span class="kw">global</span> sayac  <span class="cm"># genel de\u011fi\u015fkeni de\u011fi\u015ftir</span>\n    sayac += <span class="num">1</span>\n\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">sayac_olustur</span>():\n    deger = <span class="num">0</span>\n    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">artir</span>():\n        <span class="kw">nonlocal</span> deger  <span class="cm"># \u00e7evreleyen de\u011fi\u015fkeni de\u011fi\u015ftir</span>\n        deger += <span class="num">1</span>\n        <span class="kw">return</span> deger\n    <span class="kw">return</span> artir</code></pre></div>'

/* --- Kapan\u0131\u015flar --- */
+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Kapan\u0131\u015flar (closures)</strong>, \u00e7evreleyen kapsamlar\u0131ndaki de\u011fi\u015fkenleri o kapsam \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmay\u0131 bitirdikten sonra bile "hat\u0131rlayan" fonksiyonlard\u0131r. Bu, programlaman\u0131n en g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc kavramlar\u0131ndan biridir — s\u0131n\u0131f kullanmadan kal\u0131c\u0131 duruma sahip fonksiyonlar olu\u015fturman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flar:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># Kapan\u0131\u015f \u00f6rnek 1: Saya\u00e7 fabrikas\u0131</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">sayac_olustur</span>(baslangic=<span class="num">0</span>):\n    deger = baslangic\n    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">sayac</span>():\n        <span class="kw">nonlocal</span> deger\n        deger += <span class="num">1</span>\n        <span class="kw">return</span> deger\n    <span class="kw">return</span> sayac\n\ns1 = <span class="fn">sayac_olustur</span>()\ns2 = <span class="fn">sayac_olustur</span>(<span class="num">100</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">s1</span>(), <span class="fn">s1</span>(), <span class="fn">s1</span>())  <span class="cm"># 1 2 3</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">s2</span>(), <span class="fn">s2</span>())        <span class="cm"># 101 102  — ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z!</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Kapan\u0131\u015f \u00f6rnek 2: \u00d6nbellekleme (memoization)</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">onbellekle</span>(fonk):\n    onbellek = {}\n    <span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">sarmalayici</span>(*args):\n        <span class="kw">if</span> args <span class="kw">not in</span> onbellek:\n            onbellek[args] = <span class="fn">fonk</span>(*args)\n        <span class="kw">return</span> onbellek[args]\n    <span class="kw">return</span> sarmalayici\n\n<span class="kw">@onbellekle</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">fibonacci</span>(n):\n    <span class="kw">if</span> n < <span class="num">2</span>:\n        <span class="kw">return</span> n\n    <span class="kw">return</span> <span class="fn">fibonacci</span>(n - <span class="num">1</span>) + <span class="fn">fibonacci</span>(n - <span class="num">2</span>)\n\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">fibonacci</span>(<span class="num">50</span>))  <span class="cm"># anl\u0131k! \u00d6nbelleksiz: sonsuza kadar s\u00fcrer</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="think-box"><div class="think-label">D\u00dc\u015e\u00dcN\u00dcN</div><div class="think-body"><strong>Kapan\u0131\u015flar ML i\u00e7in neden \u00f6nemlidir?</strong> Dekorat\u00f6rler (yukar\u0131daki <code>@onbellekle</code> gibi) kapan\u0131\u015flard\u0131r. PyTorch\'un hook sistemi kapan\u0131\u015flar kullan\u0131r. Veri art\u0131rma pipeline\'lar\u0131 genellikle d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcmleri yap\u0131land\u0131rmak i\u00e7in kapan\u0131\u015flar kullan\u0131r. \u00c7\u0131kar\u0131m s\u0131ras\u0131nda kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z <code>@torch.no_grad()</code> dekorat\u00f6r\u00fc? O, gradyan hesaplamas\u0131n\u0131 devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rakmak i\u00e7in fonksiyonunuzu saran bir kapan\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.</div></div>'

/* --- Plotly: LEGB Kapsam G\u00f6rselle\u015ftirmesi --- */
+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="cg-title">LEGB Kapsam \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcmleme S\u0131ras\u0131</div></div>'
+ '<div id="plot-scope-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var scopes=["Yerle\u015fik (Built-in)","Genel (Global)","\u00c7evreleyen (Enclosing)","Yerel (Local)"];'
+ 'var widths=[90,70,50,30];'
+ 'var colors=["rgba(248,113,113,0.15)","rgba(200,169,110,0.15)","rgba(167,139,250,0.2)","rgba(78,205,196,0.25)"];'
+ 'var borders=["#f87171","#c8a96e","#a78bfa","#4ecdc4"];'
+ 'var shapes=[];var annotations=[];'
+ 'for(var i=0;i<4;i++){shapes.push({type:"rect",x0:50-widths[i]/2,x1:50+widths[i]/2,y0:i*25+5,y1:i*25+22,fillcolor:colors[i],line:{color:borders[i],width:1.5}});'
+ 'annotations.push({x:50,y:i*25+13.5,text:"<b>"+scopes[i]+"</b><br>"+(["print, len, range, True","mod\u00fcl seviyesi de\u011fi\u015fkenler","d\u0131\u015f fonksiyon de\u011fi\u015fkenleri","mevcut fonksiyon de\u011fi\u015fkenleri"][i]),showarrow:false,font:{color:borders[i],size:11}});}'
+ 'annotations.push({x:92,y:50,text:"Python i\u00e7ten<br>d\u0131\u015fa arar",showarrow:true,arrowhead:2,ax:0,ay:-60,arrowcolor:"#ebe6dc",font:{color:"#ebe6dc",size:11}});'
+ 'var layout={title:{text:"De\u011fi\u015fken Arama: LEGB Kural\u0131",font:{color:"#ebe6dc",size:14}},paper_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",plot_bgcolor:"rgba(0,0,0,0)",font:{color:"#ebe6dc"},xaxis:{visible:false,range:[0,100]},yaxis:{visible:false,range:[-3,100]},margin:{t:50,r:30,b:20,l:30},shapes:shapes,annotations:annotations,showlegend:false};'
+ 'Plotly.newPlot("plot-scope-tr",[{x:[],y:[],mode:"markers",hoverinfo:"none"}],layout,{responsive:true,displayModeBar:false});'
+ '},200)</script>'

/* ============================================================
   SECTION 6: Lambda ve Fonksiyonel Ara\u00e7lar
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">6. Lambda ve Fonksiyonel Ara\u00e7lar</h2>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Temel fikir:</strong> Python, nesne y\u00f6nelimli programlaman\u0131n yan\u0131 s\u0131ra fonksiyonel programlamay\u0131 da destekler. Lambda fonksiyonlar\u0131 anonim tek sat\u0131rl\u0131k fonksiyonlard\u0131r. <code>map()</code>, <code>filter()</code>, <code>sorted()</code> ve <code>functools</code> ile birle\u015ftirildi\u011finde, k\u0131sa ve \u00f6z veri d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme pipeline\'lar\u0131 olu\u015fturulabilir. Ancak ne zaman <strong>kullanmamam\u0131z</strong> gerekti\u011fini bilin — okunabilirlik her zaman kazan\u0131r.</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># Lambda: anonim tek ifadeli fonksiyon</span>\nkare = <span class="kw">lambda</span> x: x ** <span class="num">2</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">kare</span>(<span class="num">5</span>))  <span class="cm"># 25</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># sorted() ile key \u2014 lambda i\u00e7in #1 kullan\u0131m alan\u0131</span>\nogrenciler = [(<span class="str">"Ay\u015fe"</span>, <span class="num">92</span>), (<span class="str">"Mehmet"</span>, <span class="num">87</span>), (<span class="str">"Can"</span>, <span class="num">95</span>)]\npuana_gore = <span class="fn">sorted</span>(ogrenciler, key=<span class="kw">lambda</span> s: s[<span class="num">1</span>], reverse=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n<span class="cm"># [(\'Can\', 95), (\'Ay\u015fe\', 92), (\'Mehmet\', 87)]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># map() \u2014 her elemana fonksiyon uygula</span>\nsayilar = [<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">4</span>, <span class="num">5</span>]\nikiye_katlanmis = <span class="fn">list</span>(<span class="fn">map</span>(<span class="kw">lambda</span> x: x * <span class="num">2</span>, sayilar))\n<span class="cm"># [2, 4, 6, 8, 10]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># filter() \u2014 fonksiyon True d\u00f6nen elemanlar\u0131 tut</span>\nciftler = <span class="fn">list</span>(<span class="fn">filter</span>(<span class="kw">lambda</span> x: x % <span class="num">2</span> == <span class="num">0</span>, sayilar))\n<span class="cm"># [2, 4]</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># functools.reduce() \u2014 de\u011ferleri biriktir</span>\n<span class="kw">from</span> functools <span class="kw">import</span> reduce\ncarpim = <span class="fn">reduce</span>(<span class="kw">lambda</span> a, b: a * b, [<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">2</span>, <span class="num">3</span>, <span class="num">4</span>])\n<span class="cm"># 24  (1*2=2, 2*3=6, 6*4=24)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># functools.partial() \u2014 baz\u0131 arg\u00fcmanlar\u0131 dondur</span>\n<span class="kw">from</span> functools <span class="kw">import</span> partial\n\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">us</span>(taban, ustel):\n    <span class="kw">return</span> taban ** ustel\n\nkare = <span class="fn">partial</span>(us, ustel=<span class="num">2</span>)\nkup = <span class="fn">partial</span>(us, ustel=<span class="num">3</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">kare</span>(<span class="num">5</span>), <span class="fn">kup</span>(<span class="num">5</span>))  <span class="cm"># 25 125</span></code></pre></div>'

/* --- Lambda vs Def Kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmas\u0131 --- */
+ '<p class="l-text">Lambda m\u0131 yoksa isimli fonksiyon mu kullanmal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z? Karar \u00e7er\u00e7evesi:</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare"><div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-label">LAMBDA KULLANIN</div><div class="compare-body"><ul class="l-list"><li>Basit, tek ifade</li><li><code>sorted(key=)</code>, <code>map()</code>, <code>filter()</code>\'a ge\u00e7irme</li><li>Tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131k, yeniden kullan\u0131m gerekmiyor</li><li>Mant\u0131k ~40 karaktere s\u0131\u011f\u0131yor</li></ul><pre><code><span class="cm"># \u0130yi lambda kullan\u0131m\u0131</span>\nkelimeler.sort(key=<span class="kw">lambda</span> k: <span class="fn">len</span>(k))\n<span class="fn">max</span>(veri, key=<span class="kw">lambda</span> x: x[<span class="str">"puan"</span>])</code></pre></div></div><div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-label">DEF KULLANIN</div><div class="compare-body"><ul class="l-list"><li>Birden fazla ifade gerekiyor</li><li>Karma\u015f\u0131k mant\u0131k veya dallanma</li><li>Birden fazla yerde kullan\u0131l\u0131yor</li><li>Docstring gerekiyor</li><li>Hata i\u015fleme gerekiyor</li></ul><pre><code><span class="cm"># \u0130simli fonksiyon olarak daha iyi</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">normalize</span>(metin):\n    metin = metin.lower().strip()\n    metin = re.sub(<span class="str">r"\\s+"</span>, <span class="str">" "</span>, metin)\n    <span class="kw">return</span> metin</code></pre></div></div></div>'

/* --- Operator mod\u00fcl\u00fc --- */
+ '<p class="l-text"><code>operator</code> mod\u00fcl\u00fc, Python operat\u00f6rlerinin fonksiyon kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar. Bunlar lambdalardan daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc yeni bir fonksiyon nesnesi olu\u015fturma y\u00fck\u00fcnden ka\u00e7\u0131n\u0131rlar:</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">from</span> operator <span class="kw">import</span> itemgetter, attrgetter, mul\n<span class="kw">from</span> functools <span class="kw">import</span> reduce\n\n<span class="cm"># lambda x: x[1] yerine</span>\nogrenciler = [(<span class="str">"Ay\u015fe"</span>, <span class="num">92</span>), (<span class="str">"Mehmet"</span>, <span class="num">87</span>), (<span class="str">"Can"</span>, <span class="num">95</span>)]\npuana_gore = <span class="fn">sorted</span>(ogrenciler, key=<span class="fn">itemgetter</span>(<span class="num">1</span>))\n\n<span class="cm"># lambda a, b: a * b yerine</span>\nfaktoriyel_10 = <span class="fn">reduce</span>(mul, <span class="fn">range</span>(<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">11</span>))\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="str">f"10! = {faktoriyel_10}"</span>)  <span class="cm"># 3628800</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00c7oklu anahtar s\u0131ralama</span>\nkayitlar = [(<span class="str">"Mat"</span>, <span class="num">85</span>), (<span class="str">"BM"</span>, <span class="num">92</span>), (<span class="str">"Mat"</span>, <span class="num">91</span>), (<span class="str">"BM"</span>, <span class="num">88</span>)]\nbolum_puan = <span class="fn">sorted</span>(kayitlar, key=<span class="fn">itemgetter</span>(<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">1</span>))\n<span class="cm"># [(\'BM\', 88), (\'BM\', 92), (\'Mat\', 85), (\'Mat\', 91)]</span></code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Fonksiyonel Pipeline --- */
+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="cg-title">Fonksiyonel Pipeline: Veri D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme Ak\u0131\u015f\u0131</div></div>'
+ '<div id="plot-pipeline-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var nodes={x:[0.08,0.3,0.52,0.74,0.95],y:[0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5],mode:"markers+text",text:["Ham Veri<br>[1,-2,3,-4,5]","filter()<br>pozitif tut","map()<br>karesini al","sorted()<br>artan s\u0131ra","Sonu\u00e7<br>[1, 9, 25]"],textposition:"top center",marker:{size:[35,30,30,30,35],color:["#c8a96e","#f87171","#a78bfa","#4ecdc4","#c8a96e"],symbol:"circle"},textfont:{color:"#ebe6dc",size:11},hoverinfo:"text"};'
+ 'var arrows=[];'
